### [get_config()]{.doc-object-name .doc-function .doc-label .doc-label-method}

::: {.doc-subject}

Get the configuration dict for this provider.
:::

::: {.doc-usage-source}
Usage

[Source](https://github.com/posit-dev/raghilda/blob/docs-embedding-providers/src/raghilda/_embedding.py#L181-L195){target="_blank" rel="noopener"}
:::

::: {.doc-signature .doc-Kind.FUNCTION}
```python
get_config()
```
:::

::: {.doc-text}

The config should contain all parameters needed to recreate the provider,
except for sensitive values like API keys. It must include a "type" key
with the registered name of the provider.
:::

#### Returns {.doc-returns}

::: {.doc-definition-items}
<code> [dict]{.doc-parameter-annotation}</code>

:   Configuration dict that can be passed to `from_config()`.
:::
